  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197476",
      "title": "Improving the Buttons",
      "lectureOrder": 53,
      "videoOrder": 50,
      "sourceHash": "7e5a75f79b8dae27be36bc677cc05b51b8bb8c8735e3d1afda16c1818d3a11a7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 5.42,
          "en": "So slowly, this is taking shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.42,
          "end": 7.64,
          "en": "but of course it's still not beautiful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.64,
          "end": 10.763,
          "en": "and especially the layout here is not great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.6,
          "end": 14.35,
          "en": "So therefore that is what I wanna work on next.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.35,
          "end": 17.15,
          "en": "And as a first step it would be nice to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.15,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "position the elements inside of this input box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 22.4,
          "en": "in a different way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.4,
          "end": 24.05,
          "en": "The text input, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.05,
          "end": 25.96,
          "en": "should be centered in the middle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.96,
          "end": 29.1,
          "en": "And whilst we could have the buttons beneath each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 32,
          "en": "like this, I want to have them sit next to each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32,
          "end": 35.15,
          "en": "in one row because they don't need to be that wide.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.15,
          "end": 38.033,
          "en": "They don't need that much horizontal space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.2,
          "end": 41.32,
          "en": "Hence it's time to go back to the code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.32,
          "end": 43.58,
          "en": "And of course, just as a side note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.58,
          "end": 46.37,
          "en": "as always, feel free to pause the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.37,
          "end": 48.55,
          "en": "and try implementing this on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.55,
          "end": 51.02,
          "en": "You will need to work with flexbox",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.02,
          "end": 54.13,
          "en": "and you learned the fundamentals about flexbox already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.13,
          "end": 57.21,
          "en": "So definitely feel free to enhance the layout on your own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.21,
          "end": 59.26,
          "en": "before following along with me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.26,
          "end": 61.21,
          "en": "where we will then enhance it together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.17,
          "end": 64.73,
          "en": "Now, here is what I will do though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.73,
          "end": 66.27,
          "en": "In start game screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 69.92,
          "en": "we have this view which holds this entire input area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.92,
          "end": 73.48,
          "en": "And this view has this input container style object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.48,
          "end": 74.43299999999999,
          "en": "attached to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.37,
          "end": 79.1,
          "en": "So inside this input container style definition here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.1,
          "end": 83.57300000000001,
          "en": "I wanna control how the elements in there are laid out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.49,
          "end": 87.06,
          "en": "And since I wanna center this text input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.06,
          "end": 90.18,
          "en": "we have to add some flex properties that will take care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.18,
          "end": 91.293,
          "en": "about centering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.72999999999999,
          "end": 97.07,
          "en": "And the positioning of elements in a flexbox is controlled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.07,
          "end": 98.94,
          "en": "by using justify content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.28,
          "end": 102.303,
          "en": "and align items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.5,
          "end": 105.82,
          "en": "Now justify content will position elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.82,
          "end": 109.96000000000001,
          "en": "along the main axis which by default is top to bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.96000000000001,
          "end": 111.95,
          "en": "because the default flex direction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.95,
          "end": 114.72,
          "en": "with React Native is column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.72,
          "end": 118.3,
          "en": "And align items will position items along the cross axis",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.3,
          "end": 120.67,
          "en": "which is the opposite of the main axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.67,
          "end": 122.53,
          "en": "So at the moment, as I just said,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.53,
          "end": 125.38,
          "en": "the default is flex direction column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.38,
          "end": 127.63,
          "en": "So justify content will position items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.63,
          "end": 130.94,
          "en": "along this top to bottom axis and therefore here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.94,
          "end": 133.86,
          "en": "it doesn't matter too much what we set here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.86,
          "end": 136.04,
          "en": "We could set this to center",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.04,
          "end": 138.5,
          "en": "and temporarily remove align items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.67000000000002,
          "end": 141.61,
          "en": "and it wouldn't really have any effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.61,
          "end": 145.54,
          "en": "because the main axis, top to bottom, is occupied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.54,
          "end": 147.36,
          "en": "by the elements already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.36,
          "end": 150.6,
          "en": "And since this overall container is not higher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 150.6,
          "end": 153.42000000000002,
          "en": "than the space taken up by the elements inside of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.42000000000002,
          "end": 157.7,
          "en": "there is no extra vertical space to distribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.7,
          "end": 160.43,
          "en": "That's why this doesn't matter too much.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.43,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "Now, what does matter though, is align items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 165.89,
          "en": "which positions item along the cross axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.89,
          "end": 168.88,
          "en": "And the cross axis in this case is left to right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.88,
          "end": 171.083,
          "en": "because the main axis is top to bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.97,
          "end": 173.9,
          "en": "And here we wanna center the elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.9,
          "end": 177.32,
          "en": "so that the text input element is centered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 177.32,
          "end": 180.623,
          "en": "And this can be achieved by setting this to center.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.56,
          "end": 185.56,
          "en": "If we do this, indeed, this is centered and automatically as",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.56,
          "end": 188.51,
          "en": "a side effect, the buttons got smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.51,
          "end": 192.08,
          "en": "because before the default was stretch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 192.08,
          "end": 194.55,
          "en": "which ensured that the elements would stretch out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.55,
          "end": 197.31,
          "en": "to take the full available width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.31,
          "end": 200.17000000000002,
          "en": "The text input element doesn't stretch because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.17000000000002,
          "end": 202.64,
          "en": "we set a dedicated width on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 202.64,
          "end": 206.5,
          "en": "So we restricted the width of the element and didn't allow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 206.5,
          "end": 207.573,
          "en": "it to stretch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 208.62,
          "end": 210.49,
          "en": "Now, if we change this to center,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 210.49,
          "end": 212.95,
          "en": "we also don't stretch the buttons anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 212.95,
          "end": 215.46,
          "en": "which is why they only take the space they need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 215.46,
          "end": 217.363,
          "en": "to fit the text inside of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.2,
          "end": 220.31,
          "en": "Now that is okay for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.31,
          "end": 222.36,
          "en": "because as I don't wanna position the buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 222.36,
          "end": 225.31,
          "en": "like this, anyways, instead, as I said before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 225.31,
          "end": 228.32999999999998,
          "en": "I personally would prefer them to sit in a row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 228.32999999999998,
          "end": 230.06,
          "en": "next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 230.06,
          "end": 234.07999999999998,
          "en": "Now, for this to happen, we need to encapsulate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 234.07999999999998,
          "end": 237.67000000000002,
          "en": "these two buttons into a separate container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 237.67000000000002,
          "end": 240.35,
          "en": "As long as they are directly in the same container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 240.35,
          "end": 243.5,
          "en": "as text input, there is no way of positioning them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 243.5,
          "end": 248.5,
          "en": "in a different way but we can wrap them in an extra view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 248.82,
          "end": 252.31,
          "en": "And now it's this view, which is in the same container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 252.31,
          "end": 254.74,
          "en": "as the text input but the buttons are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 254.74,
          "end": 256.14300000000003,
          "en": "in a separate container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 257.32,
          "end": 261.51,
          "en": "If we save this, this has no immediate effect other than",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 261.51,
          "end": 263.71,
          "en": "the button size is changing again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.71,
          "end": 267.09,
          "en": "because they are now in a new flexbox container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 267.09,
          "end": 271.43,
          "en": "because every view constructs a new flexbox container -",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.43,
          "end": 273.85,
          "en": "that is something you must know - and they,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 273.85,
          "end": 275.29,
          "en": "they stretch again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 275.29,
          "end": 278.56,
          "en": "We would have to change the styling of that view to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 278.56,
          "end": 281.25,
          "en": "for example, center them again to get rid of the stretching,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.25,
          "end": 282.183,
          "en": "if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.19,
          "end": 285,
          "en": "Now, I don't wanna get rid of the stretching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285,
          "end": 288.29,
          "en": "but I do want to change the flex direction to row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 288.29,
          "end": 290.57,
          "en": "so that the buttons are next to each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 290.57,
          "end": 292.71,
          "en": "instead of beneath each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 292.71,
          "end": 296.69,
          "en": "And for this, I'll add a new styling property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 297.72,
          "end": 302.72,
          "en": "in my style sheet which I'll name buttons container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 303.06,
          "end": 305.52,
          "en": "Of course, this name is up to you as well but here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 305.52,
          "end": 308.17,
          "en": "I'll set the flex direction to row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 308.17,
          "end": 310.603,
          "en": "because now the buttons should sit in a row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 311.62,
          "end": 316.44,
          "en": "And if we do that and we add this to this view here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 316.44,
          "end": 321.14,
          "en": "we add styles.buttonsContainer as a style to this view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 321.14,
          "end": 324.07,
          "en": "then indeed, they are next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 324.07,
          "end": 327.06,
          "en": "Of course the button now have different sizes again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 327.06,
          "end": 331.44,
          "en": "and an easy way of fixing that is to, again, encapsulate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 331.44,
          "end": 334.59000000000003,
          "en": "every button into a new view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 334.59000000000003,
          "end": 337.103,
          "en": "But now every button receives its own view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 337.94,
          "end": 340.98,
          "en": "And the idea behind this is that now we have new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 340.98,
          "end": 344.15,
          "en": "flexbox containers where every flexbox container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.15,
          "end": 347.52,
          "en": "contains one button and this flexbox container here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 347.52,
          "end": 350.1,
          "en": "will again have a flex direction of column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 350.1,
          "end": 352.06,
          "en": "and the button will stretch in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 352.06,
          "end": 354.56,
          "en": "And the two flexbox containers we have here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 354.56,
          "end": 358.95,
          "en": "can now distribute the available space provided by this view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 358.95,
          "end": 361.683,
          "en": "which is the overall container for these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 362.74,
          "end": 366.11,
          "en": "Now, just by adding these views nothing changes though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 366.11,
          "end": 369.27,
          "en": "because by default, a view takes only as much space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 369.27,
          "end": 371.92,
          "en": "as is needed by its content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 371.92,
          "end": 374.02,
          "en": "But you also know what you can do about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 374.02,
          "end": 376.79,
          "en": "You can add flex one to enforce that a view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 376.79,
          "end": 379.66,
          "en": "takes as much space as available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 379.66,
          "end": 382.76,
          "en": "For this, we can add another style object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 382.76,
          "end": 385.61,
          "en": "the button container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 385.61,
          "end": 388.943,
          "en": "which only holds one button and add flex one to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 389.93,
          "end": 393.06,
          "en": "And this style object can now be assigned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 393.06,
          "end": 395.38,
          "en": "to these two views here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 395.38,
          "end": 399.94,
          "en": "So here we add style, styles button container like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 399.94,
